    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Fourth In the Ninja kato Series!\u3011</strong></h2>2D Action Game!<br>Robot Ninja Kato's training has entered the final stages!<br><br>This time, Kato's training is to conquer over 50 floors to reach his master!<br>Dodge the approaching cannonballs and use items to conquer all floors!<br>Conquer high-difficulty floors to receive high marks!<br><br>After clearing all stages, Kato will take on an even more difficult stage.<br>When all training is completed, Kato will make new history!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-- Items that support Kato ---</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Normal items\u3011</strong></h2>Recover life points/Transform into invincible/Earn coins/Erase cannonballs<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031700/extras/242b965fef38135dc30a2fcbb08e8d5e.avif?t=1721601741\" width=700 height=96 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Rare items\u3011</strong></h2>1UP/Transform into invincible/Go through walls/Turn cannonballs into coins<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031700/extras/f892263f4989861ab0fcf7dfc717d61e.avif?t=1721601741\" width=700 height=96 /></span>",
